* <strong>Google Chrome:</strong> Druk <em>Ctrl-Shift-R</em> (<em>⌘-Shift-R</em> op \'n Mac)
* <strong>Internet Explorer / Edge:</strong> Hou <em>Ctrl</em> en kliek <em>Refresh</em>, of druk <em>Ctrl-F5</em>
* <strong>Opera:</strong> Gaan na <em>Kieslys → Settings</em> (<em>Opera → Preferences</em> op \'n Mac) en dan na <em>Privacy & security → Clear browsing data → Cached images and files</em>.',
